OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FAn estimated 150,000 people marched
OL,8,Fthrough central London in the world's
OL,9,Flargest trans pride event, organisers
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FProtesters voiced anger at the new
OL,13,Fguidance on single sex-spaces and
OL,14,Fcalled on Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,15,Fto make a positive difference to trans
OL,16,Fpeople.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FSaturday's march started near the
OL,8,FBBC's central London headquarters,
OL,9,Fwhere placards read: "marching for all
OL,10,Fmy trans siblings past and present";
OL,11,Fand: "these meds save lives".
OL,13,FIt ended with crowds spilling onto
OL,14,FTrafalgar Square, filling the steps
OL,15,Fand the fountain walls to watch
OL,16,Fspeeches ` overlooked by artist Teresa
OL,17,FMargolles's sculpture of face casts
OL,18,Ffrom 726 trans, non-binary and gender
OL,19,Fnon-conforming people.
OL,26,@qD@VOUrD@cO]sD@FOUsD@\O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FIt is the first time the end point to
OL,8,Fthe rally has been the square "right
OL,9,Fin the heart of this city that belongs
OL,10,Fto us as much as anyone", said a
OL,11,Ffounding member of London Trans+
OL,12,FPride, Lewis G Burton.
OL,14,F"Every single person who marched today
OL,15,Fis proof that we are not going
OL,16,Fanywhere, that our joy is louder than
OL,17,Ftheir hate, and that London Trans+
OL,18,FPride will keep fighting, keep loving
OL,19,Fand keep growing until every trans
OL,20,Fperson is safe, seen, and free," they
OL,21,Fadded.
OL,26,@pD@_OUrD@XO]vD@AOU|D@`O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FBefore the march, a mother of a trans
OL,8,Fwoman who took her own life said "more
OL,9,Fchildren are going to die" unless Mr
OL,10,FBurnham works to reverse the "anti-
OL,11,Ftrans policies" that Sir Keir Starmer
OL,12,Foversaw.
OL,14,FAlice Litman, 20, had spent 1,023 days
OL,15,Fwaiting for gender-affirming care when
OL,16,Fshe took her own life in May 2022.
OL,26,@pD@bOUqD@ZO]rD@^OUsD@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FHer mother, former NHS psychiatrist
OL,8,FCaroline Litman, told the Press
OL,9,FAssociation that the situation for
OL,10,Ftrans people has deteriorated since
OL,11,Fthen.
OL,13,FHer youngest daughter Alice had faced
OL,14,Fname-calling, sexism, deadnaming,
OL,15,Fbiphobia and a "litany of errors" as
OL,16,Fshe tried to seek out gender-affirming
OL,17,Fcare, Ms Litman said.
OL,26,@wD@POUwD@aO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FBut she told PA: "Things have got so
OL,8,Fmuch worse, and it's just so
OL,9,Fdisappointing because my family chose
OL,10,Fto go public with (Alice's) inquest in
OL,11,Fan effort to raise awareness of the
OL,12,Fterrible wait lists and to really
OL,13,Fbring about change, and it's just got
OL,14,Fworse and worse and worse since that
OL,15,Fhappened, and it's just so
OL,16,Fdisappointing.
OL,18,F"And I kind of carry a lot of burden `
OL,19,FI feel like we have failed in our aims
OL,20,Fand it's really, really disappointing."
OL,26,@oD@ROUzD@AOU|D@gO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
