PN,37507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FShe added: "I just keep fighting, but
OL,8,Fit very often feels like nobody is
OL,9,Flistening."
OL,11,FTwo of her examples were the new
OL,12,FEquality and Human Rights Commission
OL,13,F(EHRC) guidance on single-sex spaces,
OL,14,Fand the Keeping Children Safe in
OL,15,FEducation guidance which she described
OL,16,Fas "Section 28 mark two".
OL,26,@oD@LOUqD@KO]xD@DOUxD@XO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FThe co-founder of advocacy group
OL,8,FTransparent Action added: "Andy
OL,9,F(Burnham), if you're listening, I'm
OL,10,Fthe mother of a trans child who took
OL,11,Fher life by suicide and more children
OL,12,Fare going to die on your watch if you
OL,13,Fdon't do something to reverse the anti-
OL,14,Ftrans policies that your predecessor
OL,15,Fhas overseen.
OL,17,F"This is telling you loud and clear:
OL,18,Fit will happen, and you will be
OL,19,Fresponsible.
OL,26,@pD@[OUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,F"More and more research is coming
OL,8,Fthrough every week, every month, to
OL,9,Fshow that gender-affirming care is
OL,10,Flife-saving care, especially in under-
OL,11,F18s."
OL,13,FWhile still Greater Manchester mayor
OL,14,Fin May, Mr Burnham called for Britain
OL,15,Fto have a "live and let live approach
OL,16,Fto life" when asked about EHRC
OL,17,Fguidance.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@EO]wD@KOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FHe said people need to "stop arguing",
OL,8,Ffind common ground and "start pulling
OL,9,Ftogether" ` and while the "time has
OL,10,Fcome" to implement guidance on the
OL,11,Fbasis of last year's landmark Supreme
OL,12,FCourt ruling on biological sex, it
OL,13,Fmust be done in "the fairest and most
OL,14,Fcompassionate way possible".
OL,26,@oD@XOUoD@eO]pD@XOUqD@IO]qD@[OUrD@EO]uD@
OL,26,AQOUvD@[O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FThe EHRC guidance said single-sex
OL,8,Fservices must be used on the basis of
OL,9,Fbiological sex and not gender
OL,10,Fidentity, after the Supreme Court in
OL,11,FApril 2025 ruled that the words
OL,12,F"woman" and "sex" in the Equality Act
OL,13,F2010 refer to a biological woman and
OL,14,Fbiological sex.
OL,16,FSpeaking before the march, award-
OL,17,Fwinning author Juno Dawson reminded Mr
OL,18,FBurnham: "Shall I tell you where loves
OL,19,Ftrans people? Manchester."
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@GO]tD@MOUtD@QO]zD@JOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FThe Doctor Who writer and author of
OL,8,FThis Book Is Gay, Ms Dawson, said: "If
OL,9,Fhe's going to be a Manchester Prime
OL,10,FMinister he really does need to speak
OL,11,Fout, like the press are never going to
OL,12,Fsupport him.
OL,14,F"So he needs to just ignore that voice
OL,15,Fand go with what's right, and actually
OL,16,Fwhat most women believe.
OL,18,F"By any poll, most women come out
OL,19,Fstrongly in favour of trans rights and
OL,20,Fthey are his voters, so."
OL,26,@pD@dOUvD@AOUzD@AOU|D@YO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FShe added: "Keir Starmer won in a
OL,8,Fgeneral election on a huge mandate,
OL,9,Fand part of that was pledging his
OL,10,Fsupport for the LGBT community, which
OL,11,Fhe didn't follow through with.
OL,13,F"I think Starmer was very, very scared
OL,14,Fof the British media, which is ironic
OL,15,Fbecause they were never going to
OL,16,Fsupport him ` he could have done
OL,17,Fanything and they were going to be
OL,18,Fagainst his government.
OL,26,@oD@LOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G13/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,F"So what I would say to Andy Burnham
OL,8,Fis: the tabloids aren't going to
OL,9,Fsupport you anyway, so you might as
OL,10,Fwell act with kindness and compassion."
OL,12,FShe added that there is "no Government
OL,13,Fobligation to act on that guidance"
OL,14,Fand if Mr Burnham "really wants to
OL,15,Fpledge his support to the LGBTQ+
OL,16,Fcommunity, he needs to reject that
OL,17,Fguidance".
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@gO]tD@YOUuD@cO]vD@SOUyD@IO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G14/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FStanding beside her, Hannah Jones, an
OL,8,Factress in the BBC drama What It Feels
OL,9,FLike For a Girl, said: "If we're going
OL,10,Fto go on the all Andy Burnham of it
OL,11,Fall, I would like him to speak about
OL,12,Fthe EHRC guidelines, but also include
OL,13,Fintersex people.
OL,15,F"It's not as black and white as people
OL,16,Fthink it is. There are intersections,
OL,17,Fand intersex people are in that.
OL,26,@qD@XOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G15/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,F"There are people who have
OL,8,Ftestosterone deficiencies who are cis
OL,9,Fwomen, who are maybe slightly taller,
OL,10,Fmay have beards ` may have this, may
OL,11,Fhave that ` 30% of the population are
OL,12,Fintersex and they just don't realise
OL,13,Fit.
OL,15,F"I think if we really took biological
OL,16,Fsex into account, most people wouldn't
OL,17,Fbe allowed in the bathroom."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOUyD@\O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G16/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37517
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FAlfie Bailey-Bearfield, advocacy lead
OL,8,Fat the Trans+ Solidarity Alliance,
OL,9,Fsaid this year's pride comes amid a
OL,10,F"hostile environment" for trans people.
OL,12,FTheir organisation focuses on
OL,13,Foverturning the "harm caused by For
OL,14,FWomen Scotland", who brought the
OL,15,FSupreme Court case, and ultimately the
OL,16,Fruling itself too, he said.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@UO]uD@QOUvD@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G17/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37518
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,F"I'm all too aware of the fact that as
OL,8,Fa trans man under this new guidance, I
OL,9,Fshouldn't really be going to a women's
OL,10,Ftoilet, shouldn't really be going to a
OL,11,Fmen's toilet, and that excludes people
OL,12,Flike me from public life and it's
OL,13,Faffecting non-binary people, trans
OL,14,Fwomen, trans men," Mr Bailey-Bearfield
OL,15,Ftold PA.
OL,17,FTrans+ Solidarity Alliance is "seeing
OL,18,Freally worrying huge numbers of people
OL,19,Fself-excluding" such as by quitting
OL,20,Fjobs or staying away from the office.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@RO]yD@_OU{D@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G18/20
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37519
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785172726
OL,3,C150,000 march through London in
OL,4,C'world's largest trans pride',
OL,5,Corganisers say
OL,7,FA Government spokesperson said: "The
OL,8,FGovernment is committed to protecting
OL,9,Fthe rights, dignity and safety of all
OL,10,FLGBT+ people.
OL,12,F"There are clear laws in place to
OL,13,Fprotect trans people from
OL,14,Fdiscrimination and harassment, which
OL,15,Fwe will continue to uphold.
OL,26,@oD@aOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G19/20
